setPriorityLiquidator.tree
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with Ownable: caller is not the owner
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when status is true
    │   └── it should set priorityLiquidators[liquidator] to true
    └── when status is false
        └── it should set priorityLiquidators[liquidator] to false 